// a non-generic class is lowered in its own unit during struct maps. constructed from another
// module, the consumer unit lowers the box on first use, after function maps, so typeinfo is
// written with vtables. filling those calls create_llvm_func_decl on reset() : string, which
// interns string into a table that used to hold a Structure& across that intern.
// tests_eco/classes/generic_interface_deinit is the generic cousin
$c = modiface::Pole(1);
echo $c->seed;
